t(66, 1165, """Strategic planning rests, in principle and fundamentally, on:

🔴 Assessing the situation from several directions and through variables, constants and elements
🔴 Making and drawing up what the other side does not expect, in order to surprise him with it, and studying the results and the reactions of all parties, including the party that made it""")

t(66, 1715, """🔴 Preparing early to receive what is expected from the other side and knowing the right solutions for managing his expected attacks
🔴 Preparing early to receive what is unexpected from the other side and knowing the ways to reverse the attack so that it rebounds on the attacker

All of these are an initial state of strategic planning, together with working within the frame of reality; but the details in it are many, depending on the case and the situation. There are no fixed laws that suit every case; rather, every case has fixed elements and very many changing elements

Yet despite that the planning may fail and the hostile side may win! Why might this happen?

🟥 The other, as an enemy, wins when you know nothing about him and he is unknown to you
🟥 The other, as an enemy, wins when he takes you by surprise with what you do not expect .. with what your mind did not expect
🟥 The other, as an enemy, wins when you are an open book to him
🟥 The other, as an enemy, wins when you are emotional or agitated or both
🟥 The other, as an enemy, wins when you leave him gaps and do not know them beforehand so as to close them
🟥 The other, as an enemy, wins when he besieges your resources and your ideas and makes you ignorant, so that it becomes easy for him to play with your mind, your behaviour and your actions
🟥 The other, as an enemy, wins when he plants among you those who love him and are loyal to him, not to you
🟥 The other, as an enemy, wins when you lose your passion and your tools that share the same passion with you, and he divides you
🟥 The other, as an enemy, wins when you face a psychological shock that breaks you and you surrender to it
🟥 The other, as an enemy, wins when the values of what you do and what you fight for fade from your conscience
🟥 The other, as an enemy, wins when he makes you lose your faith in the future and in possible success
🟥 The other, as an enemy, wins when he dominates the minds and souls of those around you
🟥 The other, as an enemy, wins when he tightens his grip on you so that you wish you would not wake up
🟥 The other, as an enemy, wins when he makes you someone who does not possess knowledge. Knowledge, not education.
🟥 The other, as an enemy, wins when you fail to benefit from your experiences
🟥 The other, as an enemy, wins when you persist in your mistakes
🟥 The other, as an enemy, wins when you think you are above being replaced and that it will not reach you whatever you do
🟥 The other, as an enemy, wins when he keeps you busy with trivial side battles .. keeps you busy with your relatives
🟥 The other, as an enemy, wins when he infiltrates you from your very own home; let us look at Satan, how he infiltrates a wife to ruin her husband's life and how he infiltrates a husband to ruin his wife's life
🟥 The other, as an enemy, wins when you do not understand how he thinks and have not studied his mind, his patterns of behaviour, even the looks of his eyes, the expressions of his face, his stories and his tales and what they reveal

All my talk about this “other” is not about a father, a mother, a wife, children, neighbours, brothers, acquaintances and relatives .. The talk here""")

t(67, 60, """is about strangers who could possibly be real enemies. The original idea behind my writing this post is that of international relations and international politics, not individuals, even though some of the points are suitable for the problems of individuals among themselves!""")

t(67, 420, """It destroyed the earlier peoples and it is the destroyer of the later ones, successor after predecessor""")

h(67, 750, """The ego's share: a foul tree in barren land and one of the kinds of this world's tillage!""")

t(67, 1500, """On the board: (Individual work is our love and our passion, upon which we shall die) .. Here the Arab person is manufactured as a child .. then he grows up and dies upon what he was manufactured on .. Here poets are glorified as individuals .. the leaders of history as individuals .. But the child is not told that every historical leader other than the prophets could not have succeeded without his team .. Here the distinction becomes blurred in the child's mind between individual creativity, which is praiseworthy and poses no problem, and the necessity and inevitability of cohesive, integrated collective creativity for a strong Ummah to rise .. Here the teachers and instructors stumble on the road, and most of them fall, though not all .. They do not build in our children the inevitability of collective work .. So the children grow up .. This one wants to open a business on his own, lives until the age of 70 and dies without having opened the business, because he was determined that it be his alone .. Here the manufacture of psychological illnesses begins .. Here in our schools the narcissistic personality is built, to set off afterwards spreading corruption on the earth .. It is built according to educational curricula that are not innocent in the court of reason, logic, knowledge, understanding and wisdom! Here our children's minds are manufactured not so that they grow up and build the collective structure, but so that they demolish every possible collective structure .. Here a young man is manufactured who will grow up and then say: either I alone exist, or nothing else exists!""")

h(67, 2150, """On the board: Individual work is our love and our passion, upon which we shall die""")

t(68, 470, """A European classroom, where the human being is manufactured .. Here is the beginning of the manufacture of the European youth, who becomes a young man, then a father, then a grandfather .. From childhood, then youth, then middle age, then old age, he carries with him what he learned here inside this classroom, and he dies upon it, in the collective mind!""")

h(68, 800, """On the board: Collective work is our secret""")

t(68, 1625, """The period has dragged on and the matter has gone beyond its limit! Today the world will no longer be yours alone any more than that!""")

t(69, 205, """This man wearing the teddy bear is one of three: either he is a man with very high capabilities who did not believe in the capabilities Allah gave him, and so retreated backwards because of his own self and its weakness .. or he is a man whose capabilities really are no more than wearing a teddy bear, in which case he is in fact doing real creative work and doing a good job .. or he is a man with very high capabilities, but his destiny forced him to wear a teddy bear so that he would be tested, tried and forged! The subject has nothing to do with whether wearing a teddy bear is right or wrong; that is not our subject.""")

t(69, 1470, """The European builds .. He loves working as a team .. He loves achieving collective accomplishments .. He does not resent a new member joining his team .. He is glad of it .. He considers it an addition and a value .. His goal is the accomplishment, not self-display and self-glorification .. His goal is that the result be dazzling and great .. So he accepts the creativity of others .. He accepts that he be creative and that someone else be creative too .. He does not consider that a danger to himself .. He does not consider the presence of another creative person, of 10 creative people, or the whole team being creative .. he does not consider that a threat to him or a danger that will lead to his exclusion .. This is the European's mentality. Please, if you have met Europeans who are the opposite of that, I will understand your comment as speaking of your own experience, but do not generalise .. I too do not generalise, and I know that the European is a human being like any race .. There are bound to be among them those who carry psychological illnesses, but I am speaking here of a proportion and a ratio .. I am not trying to give you the illusion that 100% of Europeans are like this .. If 90% of Europeans are like this, then this is the first, central, greatest and most important reason for their success and the success of their continent .. As for the Arabs, 90% of them are the opposite of that! Lovers of self-display .. lovers of having people say of them: he is the only successful one .. he is the only clever one .. he is the only one of his kind .. and the rest are fools and idiots! Far be it from the righteous men and women among the Arabs! This subject must be pondered deeply, seriously, transparently and impartially, because I see clearly that the European Muslim element is coming, and Allah knows best, strongly into the second universality of Islam .. coming in a very huge and very effective way, and this is one of the kinds of partial replacement of the Arabs .. partial, not total as the ignorant think!""")

t(70, 595, """When the newborn was in the doctor's hands in the maternity hospital, they said: “What a beautiful child!” The mother looked at the nurse .. The nurse hastened to say to her: “Congratulations, it is a boy .. You were created a human being complete in mind, limbs, will, strength and logic of thought .. The compulsory fate of an overpowering environment was not imposed on you .. it was not imposed on you entirely .. So you were given the means .. and you were granted many ways and multiple, varied ways out” .. This talk, of course, is not for those who were wanted on earth for something big and chosen for a great matter .. This post does not speak of them. As for those who were left life in order to live it by its means .. they must understand that every failure that befell them is in fact failure .. it is in fact failure that they caused themselves! Because those who were not chosen for something big in life were given all the means of success, since they were not sought for history and were left to live their personal test only! And they could not have succeeded in their personal test except by being given the means of a dignified life for most of their lives .. for most of it .. So whoever was not chosen for a role in history and failed is in fact a failure, and destiny has nothing to do with his failure!""")

t(70, 2020, """To every man and every woman .. Do you think you were created a follower or a slave of a man like you? Of a human being like you? Do you, as a woman, think that Allah Most High created you to live as the follower of a woman like you? Far be it from Allah, hallowed be His names, to have created us to be like this! Even the prophets were created leaders, and around them were leaders too! Even the prophets did not keep the message to themselves alone .. the disciples of Musa, then Isa, then Muhammad ﷺ, and may Allah's blessings and peace be upon all His prophets and messengers! The creative ones in human history among the leaders of knowledge and thought.. The difference between the creative and the non-creative is one thing only! That the creative one wanted his creativity intensely and for the sake of a strong goal .. noble or not noble! And he believed that Allah Most High created him creative! Do you think you are incapable and that this world contains only 20 or 100 creative people? Do you think Allah Most High created you to live humiliated, surpassed by one person or 10 or 100, while you merely live watching them and saying “I cannot excel like them”?! This is your delusion, not what Allah Most High wants for you! This is the weaving of your own mind! This is Satan's deluding of you! This is what you have done to yourself, not what the decrees of Allah Most High have done to you! In the decrees of Allah Most High there are small, medium or big stumbles! This is natural! This is natural! Or did you think you were born the son of a king or of a president? You were born of the people .. of ordinary folk .. You (woman) were born of the people .. of ordinary folk! So let every person who is astray, lost and without a compass stop .. let him stop now, before life passes him by as it passed by billions of people before him .. as it perhaps passed by his parents .. his paternal and maternal uncles .. perhaps even those who taught him at school .. They all thought that Allah Most High created them employees .. so they lived as employees and died as employees .. And employees always watch the creative ones, either with praise and love for them or""")

t(71, 60, """with envy and rancour toward them! Allah Most High did not create a single one of us an employee .. Allah Most High created us all creative .. But the problem lies in taking the easy road .. the problem lies in seeking comfort .. the safety zone .. the desire for no toil .. and no hardship .. This is what produces the employees on earth .. and this is what produces those who think themselves nothing .. those who think themselves zero .. and they believe they are so .. live so .. and die so .. The truth is that every one of us possesses something .. something no one else possesses .. I do not know what you possess .. You are the one who must know .. This is not my responsibility .. this is not my role .. I searched and asked Allah so that I might understand .. and I understood why, for example, I write .. why I write without thinking .. I write, and my mind produces nothing of what I write .. so I know that I am not the one who writes .. not my mind .. and I do not think, my reader brother, that you are unaware of the reason for that .. So whatever you find here in conformity with the Book and the Sunnah, know that it is not from me .. The reason for that is for you to benefit .. to know right from wrong .. to discover yourself in the right way .. You know from my words that I am not here to dress up and wear words, or to put on my body a coat of hollow phrases, or to compose for you a Sufi melody that entertains you! My words are not for any of this .. rather, my words are for your sake .. whatever the (religion) you embrace .. whatever the language you speak .. whatever your culture, your ideas, your emotions, your backgrounds, your history and your present! You were not created less than anyone else .. Not one of us was created less than another. Keep this from me, for I am well aware of what I am saying!""")

t(71, 1650, """This is an angry word .. not angry at .. but angry for the sake of .. a word that, as I write it, I feel anger for the sake of .. and not anger at .. anger for the sake of men and women in our Ummah who suffered and grew weary, but were defeated .. They were defeated before Satan .. and defeated before themselves .. and they grew used to defeat, and this is the most dangerous thing .. It is the most dangerous because it has become part of them .. Defeat has become the basic component of their thinking .. There are examples of brothers and sisters who over the years wrote to me seeking advice, and I ask Allah Most High that the advice benefited them .. Yet there are a few, not even as many as the fingers of one hand, whose problems I know in detail, and these amount to 2 to 5% of what I personally have seen in my life, and despite that they almost kill themselves out of grief!! This post is for them .. and this is merely a symbolic picture of them, and in her place there could just as well be a man instead of the woman! If you grow used to inner psychological defeat, then do not ask about your ruin .. do not ask, whether you are a man or a woman, about your ruin .. the ruin of your health .. the ruin of your religion and your worship .. the ruin of your future .. and Satan's domination over you! Every blackness you wake up to and fall asleep on, saying in your delusion: “I am the most miserable person in the world” .. every act like this that you do every day will bring you closer to ruin .. It is Satan's domination over you, and this domination may be old, 20 or 30 or 50 years of age, while you live it and practise it every day until you have become part of it and it has become part of you .. The transgressors, the oppressors and the aggressors in our lives exist and will not disappear .. Everyone who thinks that he alone suffers is ignorant of the reality of people's suffering, and everyone who thinks his burden is too heavy for him must know that Allah Most High gives no creature He created a burden greater than its soul can bear .. To those frustrated men and women who respond 24 hours a day, with all persistence and mastery, to Satan's demand of them that they destroy themselves: your burden is not bigger than you .. your burden is not bigger than you .. your burden is not bigger than you .. For I cannot disbelieve the word of our Great Lord, hallowed be His names, and believe that your burden is bigger than you! Every burden you carry is a burden exactly suited to your capacity to bear it and exactly matched to your abilities to live with that burden at times and to resist it at other times! Any other talk is the talk of a soul that Satan found weak, so he deluded it, deceived it and mocked it, then made it a fragile, weak, despairing soul that is almost driven to suicide by Satan's push; so beware, men, and beware, women!""")

t(72, 1005, """He is coming like a caravan ... like a stranger who passed through all the villages of the sun, carrying the promise with him .. He burned in every alley .. splintered at every bend .. and scattered at the close of every round .. Then he was raised from his thousandth ash, like the grave, except that it splits open with a funeral .. and like bones that are clothed, as a destiny with no way around it .. and like illusion that steals along behind souls preparing for a hundred battles lost before they begin .. There, from the direction of the sun, he is coming like a caravan .. like a stubborn phoenix that no wind hinders and no thunderbolts turn back!""")

t(72, 2270, """By the power of our Great, Merciful Lord .. it will calm down .. it will calm down .. it will calm down .. after all this clamour ..

The little girls will weave old dreams anew .. the youth will become a man .. and fathers and mothers will become warmth ..

And the smile will breathe again .. prayers will be love .. and nearness to the Lord will be life""")

